OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency care improving at
OL,4,ABlackpool hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust that runs Blackpool Victoria
OL,7,FHospital has made improvements in its
OL,8,Furgent and emergency care, but does not
OL,9,Falways have enough skilled staff, a
OL,10,Freport has found.
OL,12,FInspectors from the Care Quality
OL,13,FCommission (CQC) carried out an
OL,14,Finspection to see if the trust had made
OL,15,Fimprovements since 2022 when it found
OL,16,F"risks to patients were not always
OL,17,Frecognised" and rated emergency care as
OL,18,Finadequate.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
