OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency care improving at
OL,4,ABlackpool hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest unannounced visit found wait
OL,7,Ftimes to be admitted to a ward from A&E
OL,8,Fhad reduced, but patients being
OL,9,Fexamined in corridors "compromised
OL,10,Fpeople's privacy and dignity".
OL,12,FThe trust welcomed "recognition of the
OL,13,Fsignificant progress" they had strived
OL,14,Fto make as it was rated "requires
OL,15,Fimprovement".
